&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;What if you could own an entire region, from the first customer conversation to long-term growth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mews, we’re creating a new leadership role for each of our EMEA regions, and we’re hiring the Head of Region for:&lt;br&gt;Benelux, Italy, Spain, Nordic, UK&amp;amp;IRE, France and DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring commercial growth, onboarding and customer success together under one regional strategy, accountable for performance, customer outcomes and the regional P&amp;amp;L within the plan you agree with our VP of EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t just about hitting a sales target. It’s about building a regional business where every part of the customer experience works together, from winning a hotel to helping it succeed on Mews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to our VP of EMEA, lead teams across commercial, onboarding and customer success, and have a real say in how we grow, operate and deliver value in the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a rare chance to combine commercial leadership, operational ownership and genuine influence over how we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive growth across the region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the regional go-to-market plan, new ARR and revenue from customers going live. You’ll run Business Development, SMB and Mid-Market Sales, Onboarding and Customer Success to win new customers, grow existing relationships and open up opportunities across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the entire customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring sales, onboarding and customer success together around one goal: making customers successful. From signature and go-live to adoption, renewal and expansion, you’ll make sure hotels experience one connected Mews journey, with a named owner at every hand-off. You’ll build executive relationships with the region’s largest hotels and groups, own recovery plans when a customer is at risk, and work with Product, Marketing and the central support and delivery teams to turn what you hear from customers into better outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the region like a business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take ownership of the regional P&amp;amp;L within the plan agreed with the VP of EMEA, balancing revenue growth, headcount, capacity and controllable costs. You’ll work closely with Finance and RevOps to make sound commercial decisions and deliver steady performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and empower exceptional teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead through team leads and senior specialists across commercial, onboarding and customer success. Some of those teams are shared with other regions, so you’ll set up how they work together with the other regional leaders. You’ll create alignment, develop the next layer of leaders and build a culture where teams collaborate, take ownership and deliver results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape an AI-native business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re serious about using AI to change how we work. You’ll lead by example, building AI systems, tools and standards that help your team spot opportunities, make better decisions and spend more time on what matters. You’ll coach others, raise AI fluency across the region and decide where a person has to make the call.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a commercially minded leader who enjoys building businesses, developing people and connecting growth to customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of commercial success.&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in B2B SaaS or hospitality commercial roles, including at least 3 years leading teams, consistently taking teams to and beyond target. You’ve owned a commercial number and built the go-to-market plan behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end customer leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve led onboarding, customer success, implementation or delivery teams, accountable for time to go-live, adoption, retention and net revenue retention, and you’ve led a team spanning more than one discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business acumen.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve owned a P&amp;amp;L or budget, including controllable costs, headcount and margin trade-offs, ideally across commercial and customer delivery teams, and you collaborate on the plan and numbers with Finance and RevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ability to bring people together.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve developed talent, built a bench and guided teams through growth or change. You’re fluent in English and the primary language of the region, and comfortable building relationships with customers, colleagues and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI-first mindset backed by action.&lt;/strong&gt; AI Fluency Level 4, or equivalent hands-on experience: you’ve built AI tools, systems or standards that changed how a team operates, and you can show us what you built, who uses it and what changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hospitality or hotel technology, with an understanding of the challenges hotel operators face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a matrix organisation, collaborating with shared teams and influencing stakeholders across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;How we think about AI&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires &lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4&lt;/strong&gt;. That means going beyond using AI tools yourself. You’ve built systems, standards or ways of working that others rely on, you coach others on the craft, and you decide what the region acts on when AI flags patterns across it, keeping human oversight in place where it matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best customer experience comes from shared ownership of the whole journey. As Head of Region, you’ll make that real shaping not just how we grow, but how we deliver for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is open to both internal and external candidates. Internal applications are already being considered, and both processes will run in parallel. All candidates will be assessed fairly against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€84.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€121.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£91,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£118,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€103.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€125.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€141.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€155.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;983 500 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 662 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€103.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€132.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Italy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€80.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€102.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt; is a growing fintech scale-up on a mission to champion financial freedom with care. We strive to provide tailored, more affordable financial services that make people&#39;s hard-earned money go further. Now in our 14th year, with close to 400 employees in offices across Europe and the UK, we’re crafting a brilliant, relevant product that makes a difference in people&#39;s lives and the well-being of their families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve come this far by building a talented, diverse workforce on a fair culture and our strong values. Having this strong team of employees, we can serve those who really need our product to make their lives better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us as a Senior Product Designer and help shape how money moves across the globe 💸.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TransferGo, Product Design is not simply a service that turns requirements into screens. Designers are part of the product trio, working alongside Product and Engineering to understand customer problems, shape strategy and deliver experiences that create meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll lead complex initiatives from discovery through delivery across our web and mobile products. You’ll bring clarity to ambiguous problem spaces, connect customer needs with commercial and technical realities, and help teams make better product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also play an important role in raising the quality of design across TransferGo. Alongside owning your work, you’ll mentor other designers, contribute to our design practice and help us use emerging technologies, including AI to work more effectively without compromising judgement, responsibility or craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited by complex fintech challenges, care deeply about the details and want to help a growing design team increase its impact, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what you’ll do as a Senior Product Designer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead significant product initiatives from problem framing and discovery through design, validation, delivery and post-launch iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers and Engineers to define the right problems, shape product direction and balance customer value, business goals and technical feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex financial journeys and requirements into clear, accessible and trustworthy experiences across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative research, behavioural data, experimentation and product metrics to identify opportunities, evaluate trade-offs and measure the impact of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and conduct appropriate research and validation, including user interviews, usability testing, concept testing and collaborative workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and communicate a coherent design vision for your initiatives, connecting long-term direction with practical, iterative steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality user journeys, flows, wireframes, prototypes, interfaces and specifications, including edge cases and non-ideal states&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering early and throughout delivery, considering feasibility and ensuring the implemented experience meets the intended quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and evolve our design system, creating reusable patterns and improving consistency between design and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted tools thoughtfully throughout the design process; for example, to support research synthesis, problem framing, exploration, content design, rapid prototyping, data analysis and design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate AI-generated work critically, protecting customer privacy and applying human judgement to accuracy, accessibility, quality and appropriateness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate recommendations and design decisions clearly, using evidence and storytelling to build alignment and influence stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support other designers through critique, feedback and practical guidance, helping raise the team’s overall quality and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the way we work by identifying opportunities to make design processes faster, clearer and more effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to our Head of Product Design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to meet every single requirement listed. What matters most is your motivation, mindset and ability to learn. If you’re excited about this role and think you could be a great fit, we’d really like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience designing and shipping digital products within cross-functional product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating end-to-end ownership, strategic product thinking, polished UX/UI craft and measurable customer or business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of independently leading complex initiatives from an ambiguous starting point through discovery, delivery and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgement and the ability to balance desirability, usability, viability, feasibility and delivery constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced interaction and visual design skills, with close attention to detail, accessibility, consistency and usability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, including an understanding of how design decisions affect connected journeys, platforms, teams and future product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Figma, prototyping and component-based workflows, with experience contributing to or evolving design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence choosing and applying appropriate research and validation methods rather than relying on a single process for every problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using qualitative and quantitative evidence to make decisions and evaluate outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical familiarity with AI-assisted design workflows or clear evidence of actively developing this capability across areas such as ideation, research synthesis, content, prototyping, analytics or design review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to assess AI output critically, recognise its limitations and use it responsibly rather than treating it as a replacement for customer insight or professional judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, facilitation and storytelling skills, with the ability to explain decisions and influence stakeholders across disciplines and levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to collaboration with Product and Engineering, including involving partners early and navigating constraints constructively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to organise design artefacts and documentation so that decisions, specifications and context are easy for others to understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to challenge assumptions, give and receive constructive feedback, and change direction when evidence calls for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance speed and quality, make pragmatic trade-offs and move work forward without waiting for perfect information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A user-first, low-ego approach grounded in curiosity, empathy, accountability and a strong sense of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And if you can also do this stuff, even better:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing fintech, payments, banking, SaaS or other complex and regulated digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing products for customers across different countries, languages, levels of financial literacy or accessibility needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with complex data, experimentation platforms or product analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with design tokens, Code Connect, code-backed prototyping or other workflows that help close the gap between design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or sharing AI-assisted workflows, prompt libraries, design-review practices or rapid prototyping approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to product strategy, roadmap conversations or cross-team initiatives beyond your immediate product area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we believe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At TransferGo&lt;/strong&gt;, we offer competitive rewards to all people. We know that recognition is about more than just money, and we’ve fostered a culture of kudos to shine a light on the great work throughout the business, and the people making it all happen. We hold regular in person events to connect with each other and help all our TransferNauts to grow with a generous training allowance. We believe that empowering people makes for a happier and more effective workforce. This means we enable anyone who wants to pursue initiatives that deliver real value for our migrant customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Starting from 4,420 GBP - 5,530 GBP (gross) per month, depending on experience. Salary is just one part of the conversation – if you’re excited about the role but the range feels slightly off, don’t hesitate to apply. We’re open to discussing based on your experience and potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Including a generous holiday allowance, competitive healthcare insurance, and a wellbeing package from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Development Budget&lt;/strong&gt;: €1,000 to invest in your personal and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexibility to work from home and in the office, with most team members in the office two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pet-Friendly Office&lt;/strong&gt;: If you’re near one of our offices, bring your furry friend along!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive Culture&lt;/strong&gt;: Regular in-person events, fostering a strong sense of community and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowerment and Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We believe in empowering our people to take initiative and drive meaningful change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;At TransferGo, we are committed to the equal treatment of all current and prospective employees. We will not tolerate discrimination on the basis of age, disability, sex, sexual orientation, pregnancy and maternity, race or ethnicity, religion or belief, gender identity,&amp;nbsp; marriage, civil partnership or any other protected category. We are proud of our diverse and inclusive culture and we strongly encourage suitably qualified applicants from a wide range of backgrounds to apply and join TransferGo. We look forward to meeting you! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please note that all data collected will be handled in accordance with our candidates privacy policy (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&quot;&gt;https://www.transfergo.com/privacy-policy/overview&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;and will only be used for the purpose of evaluating your candidacy. The data will be securely stored and deleted according to retention timeframe set in the candidates privacy policy. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this, please feel free to reach out by replying or via -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hunter Douglas is wereldwijd marktleider in raamdecoratie en een toonaangevende producent van architecturale producten. Wij zijn een merk dat u kent en vertrouwt. Met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie hebben wij onze industrie mede vormgegeven met unieke producten die baanbrekend design en functionaliteit combineren. Onze producten zijn wereldwijd te vinden in miljoenen woningen en commerciële gebouwen. Wij zijn op zoek naar gedreven, intelligente, creatieve en ondernemende mensen. Door uitdagende functies en versnelde groeimogelijkheden te bieden, gedreven door een gezamenlijke ambitie om succesvol te zijn, creëren wij een omgeving waarin uw carrière zich verder kan ontwikkelen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ruil voor uw expertise bieden wij een competitief en uitgebreid arbeidsvoorwaardenpakket, zodat u zich gewaardeerd voelt voor de bijdrage die u levert.&amp;nbsp;Onze ambitie is om het snelst groeiende en meest geliefde raamdecoratiebedrijf ter wereld te worden. &lt;em&gt;Wat is uw ambitie?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager Soft Fabrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij bijdragen aan de ontwikkeling van hoogwaardige stoffen die hun weg vinden naar klanten door heel Europa? Krijg je energie van de combinatie van productontwikkeling, commercie en projectmanagement? Dan is dit een mooie kans om als Product Manager Soft Fabrics onderdeel te worden van ons Product Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw rol&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Product Manager Soft Fabrics ben je verantwoordelijk voor het product en het commerciële succes van onze collecties voor gordijn- en meubelstoffen. Design is verantwoordelijk voor de creatieve ontwikkeling van de stoffen. Vanuit Product Management vertegenwoordig jij de markt-, klant- en businessbehoefte. Je brengt markt- en klantinzichten in en vertaalt deze naar duidelijke productbriefings en commerciële uitgangspunten. Vervolgens bewaak je samen met Design het ontwikkelproces en stuur je op een succesvolle productintroductie en optimale productlevenscyclus. Daarbij werk je nauw samen met collega&#39;s van Sales, Marketing, Procurement, Supply Chain en het Design Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je combineert projectmanagement met commercieel inzicht, data-analyse en een passie voor textiel. Een veelzijdige rol waarin je veel verschillende mensen en disciplines bij elkaar brengt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheert het fabrics-portfolio gedurende de volledige productlevenscyclus, van concept tot uitfasering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samen met Design vertaal je marktinzichten naar productbriefings en commerciële uitgangspunten voor nieuwe stoffen en collecties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je coördineert productontwikkelingsprojecten van conceptfase tot marktintroductie, waarbij je samenwerkt met Design voor de ontwikkeling van nieuwe stoffen en collecties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bewaakt planning, voortgang, risico&#39;s, budget en afstemming tussen de verschillende betrokken teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent gedurende het ontwikkelproces een commerciële en strategische sparringpartner voor Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je analyseert markt-, klant- en verkoopdata en vertaalt inzichten naar kansen voor het portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ondersteunt bij prijsstelling, productpositionering en businesscases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt samen met Sales en Marketing aan productintroducties, trainingen en commerciële tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je zorgt voor goede productinformatie en bent een belangrijk aanspreekpunt voor interne en externe stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit breng jij mee&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent een junior/medior professional die graag verantwoordelijkheid neemt en energie krijgt van het verbinden van mensen, ideeën en projecten. Je hebt minimaal 2 jaar relevante ervaring in bijvoorbeeld productmanagement, projectmanagement, category management of een vergelijkbare functie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daarnaast heb je:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een hbo diploma in bijvoorbeeld Bedrijfskunde, Marketing, Textieltechnologie of een vergelijkbare richting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke projectmanagement- en stakeholdermanagementvaardigheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercieel inzicht en een klantgerichte instelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een analytische, data-gedreven manier van werken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met het managen van meerdere projecten en stakeholders tegelijk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede beheersing van het Nederlands en Engels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse in AI en de mogelijkheden om hiermee productiviteit, inzichten en bedrijfsprocessen te verbeteren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring binnen een productieomgeving, textiel, interieurproducten of een industriële omgeving is een pré.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent georganiseerd, proactief en hands-on. Je houdt gemakkelijk overzicht, ook wanneer er verschillende belangen en deadlines spelen. Tegelijkertijd werk je graag samen en weet je anderen mee te krijgen in jouw aanpak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waarom deze rol?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je komt terecht bij Artex in Aarle-Rixtel, maar bent deel van het Product Team van Hunter Douglas met hoofdkantoor in Rotterdam. Hunter Douglas is een wereldwijd toonaangevende speler in raamdecoratie en architecturale producten, met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Product Manager Soft Fabrics krijg je de ruimte om eigenaarschap te nemen, ideeën in te brengen en zichtbaar bij te dragen aan de toekomst van ons stoffenportfolio. Je werkt samen met collega&#39;s uit verschillende disciplines en landen en hebt een belangrijke rol in het verbinden van design, commercie en productontwikkeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij jouw ervaring inzetten in een rol waarin product, commercie en design samenkomen? Dan maken we graag kennis met je.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Door hieronder je sollicitatie in te dienen, geef je vooraf toestemming om sms-berichten te ontvangen om je op de hoogte te stellen van updates over de status van je sollicitatie en om gedurende je sollicitatieproces met je in gesprek te gaan. Je kunt de sms-service op elk moment annuleren. Stuur gewoon “STOP” als antwoord op een van onze sms-berichten om je af te melden. Er kunnen kosten voor berichten en data van toepassing zijn. De frequentie van berichten kan variëren. Als je vragen hebt over privacy, lees dan ons privacybeleid, &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt; of onze gebruiksvoorwaarden &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help people feel at home, beyond the booking.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Booking a place is only the beginning. Moving to a new country means navigating unfamiliar processes, managing payments, and building a relationship with a landlord—all while settling into a new life. At HousingAnywhere, we want people to feel supported throughout their stay, with the confidence that comes from knowing what happens next and where to turn when they need help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to own the &lt;strong&gt;Post Booking experience, with a strong focus on our mobile app&lt;/strong&gt;. You will shape how tenants and landlords use HousingAnywhere throughout a tenancy: from preparing for move-in and managing payments to getting support and extending a stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring strong mobile app design experience and product thinking to make these everyday interactions feel simple, intuitive, and reliable—helping turn HousingAnywhere into a trusted companion throughout the rental journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the long-term vision for the journey beyond the booking, making HousingAnywhere a trusted part of everyday renting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiences that help tenants and landlords prepare for move-in, manage payments, communicate clearly, and navigate issues with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how we can provide ongoing value throughout a tenancy, including renewals and longer stays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects from early discovery through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative research, behavioural data, and experimentation to make decisions, not opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success, measure impact, and continuously improve your solutions—connecting customer trust and satisfaction with adoption, retention, and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar across the design team through thoughtful critique and craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our design principles, design system, and the way we build the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate deeply. Design with absolute purpose.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside Product, Engineering, Research, and Data as an equal partner to challenge assumptions, validate ideas, and turn ambiguity into a product that genuinely improves people&#39;s lives. You&#39;ll also collaborate closely with our operational teams to understand where the digital experience meets the realities of moving in and renting a home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, we think ahead, and we focus on what our audience truly needs. You&#39;ll have the freedom to influence your team’s strategy in an environment that values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elegant interaction design and meaningful micro-interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear design principles and consistent systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality over shortcuts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shipping fast matters. Shipping something we&#39;re proud of matters even more. If you thrive on autonomy and solving complex puzzles, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7+ years of experience designing complex digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing native mobile apps for iOS and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product thinking and problem framing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interaction and visual design craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketplaces, search or discovery products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running discovery and validating ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with data, metrics and experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with engineers and product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio showing not only what you designed – but why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holidays, minimum-based not maximum!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Rotterdam office with hybrid working policy (2 office days).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work remotely for up to 2 months per year!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1,000 EUR personal development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete coverage for commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal equipment, including laptop and ergonomic setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership discount with GoVital or OneFit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch/English classes budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variable pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse international community (46+ nationalities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly office in Rotterdam city centre.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and after-work drinks every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://poly.ai?utm_source=prnewswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=pressrelease&amp;amp;utm_campaign=boilerplate&amp;amp;utm_content=pressrelease&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PolyAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the Agentic Dialog Platform for building the conversational enterprise, used to build, run, govern, and improve dialog agents at scale. Powered by Raven, a proprietary dialog model trained on more than a billion enterprise conversations, PolyAI agents are built for complexity, open at every layer, and sovereign by design. PolyAI serves hundreds of enterprises across 75 languages and 25 countries, including Metro Bank, Marriott, PG&amp;amp;E, and UniCredit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;PolyAI is hiring a Senior Manager, EMEA Marketing to help own our marketing strategy and pipeline contribution across the EMEA region. You will build and run EMEA marketing, with a focus on pipeline and PLG-to-sales handoff. You will focus on field events, campaigns and webinars that build awareness and demand among enterprise buyers and developers in EMEA, and set the regional marketing plan with Sales, Partnerships and the global Marketing team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role suits a hands-on marketer who has helped a platform or developer-led business move from product-led growth (PLG) to a sales-led (SLG) motion. You will adapt global programs to local markets, report on regional results to senior leadership, and coach the people and agencies who deliver the work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll own and be measured on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;EMEA-sourced pipeline against target&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The UK/I and DACH marketing plans, including priorities by country and segment, agreed with regional Sales leadership&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The events program: strategic, partner and field events, from strategy through to on-site execution&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Growing our international database&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The PLG-to-SLG handoff with local BDRs, including lead routing, follow-up plays and shared reporting&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Reporting on cost per outcome, conversion and ROI, and adjusting the plan using the data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll influence, working with our central marketing teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Financial Services and Healthcare plays in EMEA (with Product Marketing)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Customer evidence and logos for the region&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;PR, comms and regional stories&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Launches, sales assets and localization (with Product Marketing, Design and Brand)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Campaigns, events and combined motions in EMEA (with Demand Generation)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;4-6 years in B2B marketing, including field marketing, events and campaigns, with recent regional or EMEA ownership&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;A record of building a regional marketing plan from scratch and meeting a pipeline target, with results you can quantify&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience marketing a platform, developer or technical product, and helping move a business from product-led growth (PLG) to a sales-led (SLG) motion&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience working with BDRs/SDRs and sales leaders on lead quality, routing and attribution, including influencing them without owning them, and the confidence to push back on sales and channel requests when priorities need to be set&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Working knowledge of EMEA markets, including cultural, language and regulatory differences (for example GDPR)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Strong partnership skills: you get what you need from central teams through clear asks and shared plans&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience with Salesforce and a marketing automation platform&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Clear, collaborative communication with senior executives and technical audiences&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Willingness to travel for in-person events&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive base salary, shaped by your experience and location, plus equity — so you share in the value you help create.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;💰&lt;/span&gt; Participation in the company’s employee share options plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🏝&lt;/span&gt; Tenure-Based PTO: You will receive 25 holidays when you join and will gain an additional 1 day after 2 years of service, then 1 day each year until capped at 32 holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🏡&lt;/span&gt; Flexible working from home policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🌎&lt;/span&gt; Work from outside of the UK for up to 6 months each year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🫂&lt;/span&gt;TELUS Health EAP 24/7 - offers you and your chosen family confidential, judgment-free support for any work, health, or life challenge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;/span&gt; Enhanced parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🚲&lt;/span&gt; Bike2Work scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;📚&lt;/span&gt; Annual learning and development allowance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🏡&lt;/span&gt; We’re all about making WFH work for you - that’s why we offer a one-off WFH allowance when you join. Offering perks like noise-cancelling headphones or a comfortable desk chair to boost your comfort and focus!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emojipedia.org/family-man-woman-girl/&quot;&gt;👨‍👩‍👧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Company-funded fertility and family-forming programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emojipedia.org/cherry-blossom/&quot;&gt;🌸&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Menopause care programme with Maven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🏥&lt;/span&gt; Private healthcare and dental cover, discounts on gym members and relaxation apps, and access to a range of mental health programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;🌎&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sabbatical Program: 5-week paid sabbatical available after 5 years of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;At PolyAI, we take great pride in our values - they guide everything we do. We believe that a strong culture leads to meaningful work and lasting impact.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Our core values are:&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/only-the-best/63f754d467834139.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:only-the-best:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Only the best&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We expect the best from our people, we hire people that expect the best from themselves, and we nurture this drive for excellence.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/ownership/753f47103884882c.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:ownership:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We care deeply about what we do. We take ownership of our initiatives, decisions and outcomes.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/relentlessly-improve/b5e1910b7c09b966.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:relentlessly-improve:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relentlessly improve&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We demand more from ourselves and are always evolving. Continuous, obsessive improvement is the only way we will transform the world of conversational AI.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/bias-for-action/0a5bd6888d3f2db1.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:bias-for-action:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our world moves quickly and so do we. We take calculated risks and we deliver impact fast.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/disagree-and-commit/0cee7f9f02baac38.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:disagree-and-commit:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Disagree and commit&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are all working toward the same goal. If we donʼt agree with something, we work hard to understand it and when a decision is made, we accept it and give it our all.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/build-for-people/9c2fba2ffb2331c8.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:build-for-people:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build for people&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We want the world to enjoy the experiences they have with us. We are building for a future that prefers automation.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;PolyAI is proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. All employment decisions at PolyAI will be based on the business needs without attention to ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, neurodiversity status or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kindly find the Privacy Notice for our recruitment process by following the link &lt;a href=&quot;https://polyai.notion.site/Recruitment-Privacy-Notice-1b5097db17f7802ead64dd6daf159ded&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. This document provides important information regarding how we handle your personal data throughout the recruitment journey.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Rennes, France.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chance to apply closes:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; 6th of November 2026.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Engineer at IDnow is the &lt;strong&gt;client&#39;s trusted advisor through pre-sales and integration&lt;/strong&gt;. You design the solution the client will rely on, you give them confidence that it will work in their environment, and you become the person they turn to for technical and solution decisions. &lt;strong&gt;Your focus is the technical side of the journey up to the point where the client is live on our products, and you make that path smooth&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, deeply technical role, and a commercial one&lt;/strong&gt;. Solutions Engineers carry a quota and are measured on two things: the deals they help win, and whether the client goes live successfully. &lt;strong&gt;You work hand in hand with Sales &lt;/strong&gt;to convince the client that our solution is the right one and to move them toward signature, and then you make sure they can use it well in production. You earn that through technical depth, but you are client-facing, credible and persuasive in a sales motion. You do this across our whole client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire this role at more than one level. The core of the job is the same; the scope you own and the complexity you handle grow with your experience. This role carries real ownership across the client journey, and a say in how the work evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Discover and Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, qualifying conversion rates, false acceptance and rejection trade-offs, fraud exposure and integration constraints before proposing a solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solution architectures that orchestrate document verification, digital identity, fraud signals, biometric authentication, eID and EU Digital Identity Wallet flows, and e-signature,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Link every technical choice to the client’s business objectives and Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), so proposals speak to outcomes rather than features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define defensible architecture decisions covering fallback logic, data residency, scalability and performance,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales with proposals, Requests for Proposal (RFPs) and Requests for Information (RFIs), advising on which capabilities to combine and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Prove, Integrate and Go Live&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proof-of-concept and pilot engagements, configuring Application Programming Interface (API) integrations, building Postman collections and managing sandbox environments,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate behaviour under realistic conditions and document what the client needs to go live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide client developers through API and mobile Software Development Kit (SDK) integration, including webhooks, authentication and testing,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot integration issues by reading logs and diagnosing failures at the API and SDK level, rather than only forwarding them,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a living integration map of the client’s architecture, data flows and dependencies,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the account from signature to go-live, running the go-live plan and handing a documented account to Customer Success and Support at the end of hypercare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Advise and Enable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted advisor relationships with business and technical stakeholders, from first conversation to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the client’s technical reality internally, feeding integration blockers, product gaps and pilot learnings back to Product and Sales teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the internal escalation team on deeper platform issues, arriving with clear technical context,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand alongside Sales in client meetings, addressing objections on integration effort, feasibility and alternatives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve demo environments, architecture templates and integration guides, and mentor team members as the practice grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-57a6ed87-9a65-412d-b52c-7002d3fb072d section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title&quot; data-v-51f33a98=&quot;&quot; data-v-fd08594a=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-7525b616-170d-49ba-8189-de0a0bb7b01f section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title&quot; data-v-51f33a98=&quot;&quot; data-v-fd08594a=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;editable-element-layer&quot; data-v-607a5d63=&quot;&quot; data-v-422f1a2b=&quot;&quot; data-v-fd08594a=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;text-element editable-element editable-text-element&quot; data-v-fd08594a=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-element-header_text-2&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You ask before you propose and qualify before you demo, turning ambiguous client requirements into the right technical solution. You take ownership of the client’s technical path from first conversation to production, and you explain complex systems in plain language to engineers and business leaders alike. You combine hands-on engineering depth with a commercial mindset, and you enjoy working alongside Sales to move a decision forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering or technical degree&lt;/strong&gt;, a Master’s degree in a relevant field, or equivalent practical experience,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience in solutions engineering, technical consulting, or implementation and onboarding in SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in identity, FinTech or security,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and qualification skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to turn an ambiguous client requirement into the best technical solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution architecture skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing integration flows, explaining orchestration logic and defending trade-offs with a client’s engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on technical skills&lt;/strong&gt; with APIs, Software Development Kits (SDKs) including &lt;strong&gt;mobile, and integration tooling&lt;/strong&gt; such as Postman and Git,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running a proof of concept and debugging an integration at the API or log level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery discipline to run an integration and onboarding through to a committed go-live date, managing several client projects at once,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate technical complexity into plain language and reassure non-technical stakeholders,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value awareness&lt;/strong&gt;, connecting the technical solution to client outcomes such as verification conversion, fraud loss or time to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-facing presence, building trusted advisor relationships with business stakeholders such as Chief Digital Officers (CDOs) and Heads of Digital, and technical stakeholders such as Chief Technology Officers (CTOs), architects and platform engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct to own the client’s technical path end to end,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and full professional French are both hard requirements for the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with identity verification, Know Your Customer (KYC), Know Your Business (KYB) or Anti-Money Laundering (AML) processes, including document verification, biometrics, liveness detection, eID and fraud detection,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in where digital identity is heading, including eIDAS 2.0, EU Digital Identity Wallets, the EU Anti-Money Laundering Regulation and General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR),&lt;/li&gt;
