&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Collaborate with peers across the business, acting as the primary finance point of contact for assigned Capability Unit, coordinating effectively with domestic and international stakeholders (including USA and Germany), as well as European accounting and tax offices &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
